One named house root. `LAR_ROOT` alone (unset refuses `HouseRootUnnamed`, no XDG/home fallback), TS and Python welded. Tree: `hearth/` (the only thing a re-found clears) · `library/` · `projections/` · `config/` · `cache/` · `run/`. Private and house-minted projections (incl. `wikis/daemon-<F>`, `bags/kahua-<F>`, draft recovery) live under `projections/`; fsync'd atomic writes; the hidden-row cure; a one-way, redacted observe render of `bags/daemon` (cap/** excluded, toggle in config). Container: `LARES_HOUSE` binds hearth/projections/library/config under `/lar`; `reset` clears the hearth alone. Suites name a scratch root per worker. Operator rulings 2026-11-08 (hearth/ restructure; XDG fallback retired; face-bound daemon wiki).

